# 1️⃣ Count Positive Elements

### 📌 Problem

Count how many positive numbers are present in an array.

### 💻 Code

```java
package p2;

public class CountPosElements {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int[] arr = {-2, 5, -7, 8, 0, 3, -1};
        int count = 0;

        for (int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {

            if (arr[i] > 0) {
                count++;
            }
        }

        System.out.println("Count = " + count);
    }
}
```

### 📤 Output

```text
Count = 3
```

### 🔍 Dry Run

```text
-2 → skip
 5 → count = 1
-7 → skip
 8 → count = 2
 0 → skip
 3 → count = 3
-1 → skip
```

### 🧠 Pattern

```java
if (arr[i] > 0) {
    count++;
}
```

### ⏱️ Complexity

* Time: `O(n)`
* Space: `O(1)`

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

